WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.250
Learning, powered by AI.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:12.450
Aristocrat doesn't just add technology to education. It brings the methods of the world's best places of thought to every learner.

3
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:23.200
Its AI tutor is trained not only to know teaching methods, but to apply them: to challenge a student, step by step, and bring out their best.

4
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:38.150
Behind it is a three-part loop. A teacher teaches, a student responds, and an observer judges what worked. Every round of feedback trains a better teacher. It's a system only AI can run.

5
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:44.750
Our goal is to bring it to as many regions as possible, at the lowest possible cost.

6
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:51.550
Not just to make scholars, but aristocrats of thought.
